// Inverted-Fullback 3-2-5 manager archetype — hand-authored, NOT LLM-baked.
//
// Guardiola-school modern hybrid. Fullbacks invert into the double-pivot
// zone when in possession, allowing the team to attack with a 3-2-5
// shape (3 CBs + 2 inverted FBs + 5 attackers). Moderate risk appetite
// (0.60) — system depends on coordinated FB inversions which take time
// to execute + leave wide channels exposed mid-rotation. CATALOG-HIGH
// possession preference (0.85) — possession is the engine that drives
// the inverted-FB advances; without it the 3-2-5 shape never materializes.
//
// Q32 raw-bits computation (BAKE-TIME math; never in canonical paths):
//   risk_appetite:         0.60 × 2^32 = 2_576_980_377.6 → 2_576_980_378
//   possession_preference: 0.85 × 2^32 = 3_650_722_201.6 → 3_650_722_202
//
// Tactical archetype reference resolves to content/sources/archetypes/
//   inverted-fullback-3-2-5.ron  (validated at load time by ContentStore).
//
// Authored 2026-05-17 (T2-1c).

